cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "onthefly-distill: on-the-fly MLIP distillation to a CPU NN-MTP student"
authors:
  - family-names: Moon
    given-names: Jinuk
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-2.0-only
abstract: >
  A self-contained framework to distill any teacher machine-learning interatomic
  potential (MLIP) into a CPU-deployable LAMMPS NN-MTP student via an
  active-learning loop (teacher MD -> train student -> student LAMMPS MD ->
  relabel pre-crash frames -> retrain).
references:
  - type: software
    title: "LAMMPS Molecular Dynamics Simulator"
    notes: >
      The NN-MTP pair style (lammps/src/pair_nnmtp*) is derived from LAMMPS
      (Sandia National Laboratories), distributed under GPL-2.0.
    url: "https://www.lammps.org"
